---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who runs this: Hari Prathap, IITH M.Tech student and customer success engineer.">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div class="page-head-text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Hyderabad, India</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Student, engineer, and keeper of this dashboard.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I am doing an M.Tech in Techno-Entrepreneurship at IIT Hyderabad and working
        customer success engineering at an AI voice startup at the same time. Days are
        support traces and shipped fixes; evenings are coursework; the gaps in between
        are where the projects happen.
      </p>
      <p>
        I build with Claude Code, end to end: records platforms, compliance bridges,
        analytics warehouses, small tools that fix one annoying thing properly. Most of
        what I learn comes from shipping something real and watching where it breaks.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is the dashboard I actually use. Assignments, courses, and builds go
        in as entries; the software keeps the score. If something here is useful to you,
        take it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0 0;">
    <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/Hari487-coder">
      <Icon name="lucide:github" /> github.com/Hari487-coder
    </a>
  </p>
</Base>
